Subject: Preserve the original camera transition fabs expression on native hosts

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Upstream now owns the Thwomp event as ThwompObject* plus eThwompState,
produces it from thwomp->mState and consumes THWOMP_STATE_FALLING. Retire
the superseded opaque pointer/copied-word adaptation and its helper include.
Keep those original typed event declarations, producer, handlers and lifetime.

